{"path":"numeric/complex/cosh","title":"std::cosh(std::complex)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>cosh<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(std::complex)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric/complex/cosh","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"Computes complex hyperbolic cosine of a complex value z.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/complex\">&lt;complex&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <br>complex<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> cosh<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> complex<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> z <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Computes complex hyperbolic cosine of a complex value <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code>. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> z\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> complex value\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>If no errors occur, complex hyperbolic cosine of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code> is returned.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Error_handling_and_special_values\">Error handling and special values</h3>\n<p>Errors are reported consistent with <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/math_errhandling\">math_errhandling</a></span>.\n</p><p>If the implementation supports IEEE floating-point arithmetic,\n</p>\n<ul><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/cosh\"><span class=\"kw1349\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cosh</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex/conj\"><span class=\"kw2708\">std::<span class=\"me2\">conj</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>z<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex/conj\"><span class=\"kw2708\">std::<span class=\"me2\">conj</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/cosh\"><span class=\"kw1349\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cosh</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>z<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/cosh\"><span class=\"kw1349\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cosh</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>z<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/cosh\"><span class=\"kw1349\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cosh</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span>z<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>\n</li><li> If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code> is <code>(+0,+0)</code>, the result is <code>(1,+0)</code>\n</li><li> If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code> is <code>(+0,+∞)</code>, the result is <code>(NaN,±0)</code> (the sign of the imaginary part is unspecified) and <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/fenv/FE_exceptions\">FE_INVALID</a></span> is raised\n</li><li> If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code> is <code>(+0,NaN)</code>, the result is <code>(NaN,±0)</code> (the sign of the imaginary part is unspecified)\n</li><li> If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code> is <code>(x,+∞)</code> (for any finite non-zero x), the result is <code>(NaN,NaN)</code> and <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/fenv/FE_exceptions\">FE_INVALID</a></span> is raised\n</li><li> If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code> is <code>(x,NaN)</code> (for any finite non-zero x), the result is <code>(NaN,NaN)</code> and <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/fenv/FE_exceptions\">FE_INVALID</a></span> may be raised\n</li><li> If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code> is <code>(+∞,+0)</code>, the result is <code>(+∞,+0)</code>\n</li><li> If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code> is <code>(+∞,y)</code> (for any finite non-zero y), the result is <code>+∞cis(y)</code>\n</li><li> If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code> is <code>(+∞,+∞)</code>, the result is <code>(±∞,NaN)</code> (the sign of the real part is unspecified) and <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/fenv/FE_exceptions\">FE_INVALID</a></span> is raised\n</li><li> If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code> is <code>(+∞,NaN)</code>, the result is <code>(+∞,NaN)</code>\n</li><li> If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code> is <code>(NaN,+0)</code>, the result is <code>(NaN,±0)</code> (the sign of the imaginary part is unspecified)\n</li><li> If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code> is <code>(NaN,+y)</code> (for any finite non-zero y), the result is <code>(NaN,NaN)</code> and <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/fenv/FE_exceptions\">FE_INVALID</a></span> may be raised\n</li><li> If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code> is <code>(NaN,NaN)</code>, the result is <code>(NaN,NaN)</code>\n</li></ul>\n<p>where <span class=\"texhtml\">cis(y)</span> is <span class=\"texhtml\">cos(y) + i sin(y)</span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\nMathematical definition of hyperbolic cosine is <span class=\"texhtml\">cosh z = <span class=\"t-mfrac\"><table><tr><td>e<span class=\"t-su\">z<br></span>+e<span class=\"t-su\">-z<br></span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td></tr></table></span></span>.\n<p>Hyperbolic cosine is an entire function in the complex plane and has no branch cuts. It is periodic with respect to the imaginary component, with period 2πi.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Examples\">Examples</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cmath&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;complex&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>   \n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/fixed\"><span class=\"kw1801\">std::<span class=\"me2\">fixed</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex\"><span class=\"kw1480\">std::<span class=\"me2\">complex</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> z<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu16\">1.0</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">0.0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// behaves like real cosh along the real line</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"cosh\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> z <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/cosh\"><span class=\"kw1349\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cosh</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>z<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" (cosh(1) = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/cosh\"><span class=\"kw1349\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cosh</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\")<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex\"><span class=\"kw1480\">std::<span class=\"me2\">complex</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> z2<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu16\">0.0</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">1.0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// behaves like real cosine along the imaginary line</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"cosh\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> z2 <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/cosh\"><span class=\"kw1349\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cosh</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>z2<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" ( cos(1) = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/cos\"><span class=\"kw1342\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cos</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\")<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>cosh(1.000000,0.000000) = (1.543081,0.000000) (cosh(1) = 1.543081)\ncosh(0.000000,1.000000) = (0.540302,0.000000) ( cos(1) = 0.540302)</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex/sinh\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>sinh<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::complex)</span></span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  computes hyperbolic sine of a complex number (<span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"{\\small\\sinh{z}}\">sinh(z)</span>) <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex/tanh\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>tanh<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::complex)</span></span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  computes hyperbolic tangent of a complex number (<span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"{\\small\\tanh{z}}\">tanh(z)</span>) <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex/acosh\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>acosh<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::complex)</span></span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  computes area hyperbolic cosine of a complex number (<span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"{\\small\\operatorname{arcosh}{z}}\">arcosh(z)</span>) <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/cosh\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>cosh</span><span>coshf</span><span>coshl</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  computes hyperbolic cosine (<span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"{\\small\\cosh{x}}\">cosh(x)</span>) <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/valarray/cosh\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>cosh<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::valarray)</span></span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  applies the function <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/cosh\">std::cosh</a></span> to each element of valarray <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/ccosh\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>ccosh</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Error handling and special values","id":"Error_handling_and_special_values"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Examples","id":"Examples"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics library"},{"path":"numeric/complex","title":"std::complex"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::cosh(std::complex)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Computes complex hyperbolic cosine of a complex value z."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"z"},{"label":"Return value","note":"If no errors occur, complex hyperbolic cosine of z is returned."},{"label":"Error handling and special values","note":"Errors are reported consistent with math_errhandling."},{"label":"Notes","note":"Mathematical definition of hyperbolic cosine is"},{"label":"Examples"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"sinh(std::complex)","note":"computes hyperbolic sine of a complex number (sinh(z))"},{"label":"tanh(std::complex)","note":"computes hyperbolic tangent of a complex number (tanh(z))"},{"label":"acosh(std::complex)","note":"computes area hyperbolic cosine of a complex number (arcosh(z))"},{"label":"cosh, coshf, coshl","note":"computes hyperbolic cosine (cosh(x))"},{"label":"cosh(std::valarray)","note":"applies the function std::cosh to each element of valarray"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":433,"codeBlockCount":2}
